    {
      "chunkIndex": 2,
      "contentPreview": "Why it stayed hidden: the pre-branch windowing scheme stamped 0-based window ordinals directly as the stored ChunkIndex, and UpsertAsync\u0027s own per-call dedup (Name\u002BChunkIndex match) happened to collide with old vectors at the same low index in the one test exercising this path (EmbeddingReindexerTests.ForceReindex_RebuildsWhenSignaturesMatch), masking the missing load. Task 4\u0027s new element-based indexing (elementIndex*1000\u002BwindowOrdinal) no longer collides with low legacy indices, so the bug sur",
