    {
      "chunkIndex": 3,
      "contentPreview": "Fix: mirrored UpsertAsync\u0027s lazy-load-on-cache-miss block into RemoveAsync verbatim (TryLoadFromDisk, throw VectorStoreUnavailableException if not authoritative, populate _scopeVectors before proceeding). This restores the atomic-replace guarantee MemoryVectorIndexer.IndexAsync\u0027s docs already promised. Re-verify this fix survives if VectorStore.cs is touched again \u2014 it was outside Task 4\u0027s stated file list, added because it blocked the test gate.",
