    {
      "chunkIndex": 4,
      "contentPreview": "Practical implication for future work: any fresh VectorStore instance whose FIRST operation on a scope is RemoveAsync (e.g. ForceReindexAsync/ReindexIfStaleAsync\u0027s first item in a scope, or BuiltInEmbeddingsService\u0027s first append right after server start) was previously at risk of accumulating orphaned vectors rather than replacing them. Watch for this pattern if similar remove-then-upsert flows are added elsewhere.",
